==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[4th Anniversary Birthday Cake]] spawns as the boss.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~33.33 seconds<sup>60f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spamming quick units such as [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]], [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cow Cat]] can easily beat the stage.

